{"seq":2,"slug":"ui-testing-compose","title":"Compose UI 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/ui-testing-compose","wordCount":601,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"compose-ui-测试\">Compose UI 测试</h1><p>Jetpack Compose 提供了内置的 UI 测试框架，通过语义树（Semantic Tree）查找和操作 UI 元素。Compose 测试运行速度比传统 Espresso 更快，API 更简洁。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose UI 测试围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ComposeTestRule</strong>：测试入口，<code>createComposeRule()</code> 测独立 Composable，<code>createAndroidComposeRule&lt;Activity&gt;()</code> 测 Activity 集成（可配合 <code>@HiltAndroidTest</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>语义匹配器</strong>：通过文本、测试标签、无障碍描述查找节点（<code>onNodeWithText</code> / <code>onNodeWithTag</code> / <code>onNodeWithContentDescription</code>），<code>Modifier.testTag()</code> 是最稳定的定位方式。</li>\n<li><strong>断言与操作</strong>：断言验证节点状态（可见、启用、开关、文本），操作模拟用户交互（点击、输入、滑动、长按、滚动）。</li>\n<li><strong>截图测试</strong>：与截图工具集成，捕获 UI 快照做视觉回归。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"composetestrule\">ComposeTestRule</h2><p><code>ComposeTestRule</code> 是 Compose UI 测试的入口，提供设置 Composable 内容和查找节点的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class LoginScreenTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val composeRule = createComposeRule()&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginScreen_displaysAllElements() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            LoginScreen(&#10;                onLogin = {},&#10;                onForgotPassword = {}&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;用户名&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;密码&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;忘记密码？&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginButton_disabledWhenFieldsEmpty() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            LoginScreen(onLogin = {}, onForgotPassword = {})&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;).assertIsNotEnabled()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginButton_enabledWhenFieldsFilled() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            LoginScreen(onLogin = {}, onForgotPassword = {})&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;用户名&quot;).performTextInput(&quot;admin&quot;)&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;密码&quot;).performTextInput(&quot;password123&quot;)&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;).assertIsEnabled()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class LoginScreenTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val composeRule = createComposeRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginScreen_displaysAllElements() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LoginScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onLogin = {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onForgotPassword = {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"用户名\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"密码\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"登录\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"忘记密码？\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginButton_disabledWhenFieldsEmpty() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LoginScreen(onLogin = {}, onForgotPassword = {})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"登录\").assertIsNotEnabled()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginButton_enabledWhenFieldsFilled() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LoginScreen(onLogin = {}, onForgotPassword = {})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"用户名\").performTextInput(\"admin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"密码\").performTextInput(\"password123\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"登录\").assertIsEnabled()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种 TestRule 对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rule</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>Hilt 支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>createComposeRule()</code></td>\n<td>独立 Composable 测试</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>createAndroidComposeRule&lt;Activity&gt;()</code></td>\n<td>Activity 集成测试</td>\n<td>是（配合 <code>@HiltAndroidTest</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 优先使用 <code>createComposeRule()</code> 测试独立 Composable，只有需要 Activity 上下文或 Hilt 注入时才使用 <code>createAndroidComposeRule</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"语义匹配器\">语义匹配器</h2><p>Compose 测试通过语义属性查找 UI 节点，支持多种匹配方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ProductListScreenTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val composeRule = createComposeRule()&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun productList_displaysItems() {&#10;        val products = listOf(&#10;            Product(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;Kotlin 实战&quot;, 89.0),&#10;            Product(&quot;2&quot;, &quot;Compose 入门&quot;, 79.0)&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            ProductListScreen(products = products)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Kotlin 实战&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;¥89.0&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Compose 入门&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun searchBar_filtersProducts() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            ProductListScreen(products = sampleProducts)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;search_bar&quot;).performTextInput(&quot;Kotlin&quot;)&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Kotlin 实战&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;        composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Compose 入门&quot;).assertDoesNotExist()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun productCard_showsCorrectBadge() {&#10;        composeRule.setContent {&#10;            ProductCard(product = Product(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;热销&quot;, 99.0, isHot = true))&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        composeRule&#10;            .onNodeWithContentDescription(&quot;热销标记&quot;)&#10;            .assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductListScreenTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val composeRule = createComposeRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun productList_displaysItems() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val products = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Product(\"1\", \"Kotlin 实战\", 89.0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Product(\"2\", \"Compose 入门\", 79.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductListScreen(products = products)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Kotlin 实战\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"¥89.0\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Compose 入门\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun searchBar_filtersProducts() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductListScreen(products = sampleProducts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"search_bar\").performTextInput(\"Kotlin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Kotlin 实战\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Compose 入门\").assertDoesNotExist()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun productCard_showsCorrectBadge() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductCard(product = Product(\"1\", \"热销\", 99.0, isHot = true))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeRule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .onNodeWithContentDescription(\"热销标记\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用查找方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>匹配依据</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>onNodeWithText</code></td>\n<td>文本内容</td>\n<td><code>onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onNodeWithTag</code></td>\n<td>测试标签</td>\n<td><code>onNodeWithTag(&quot;submit_btn&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onNodeWithContentDescription</code></td>\n<td>无障碍描述</td>\n<td><code>onNodeWithContentDescription(&quot;返回&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onNode(hasText(&quot;&quot;))</code></td>\n<td>语义匹配器</td>\n<td>灵活组合条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onAllNodesWithText</code></td>\n<td>多节点匹配</td>\n<td><code>onAllNodesWithText(&quot;删除&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[查找节点] --&gt; B{匹配方式}&#10;    B --&gt; C[onNodeWithText]&#10;    B --&gt; D[onNodeWithTag]&#10;    B --&gt; E[onNodeWithContentDescription]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;onNode(matcher)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; G[断言 / 操作]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;&#10;    classDef matcherStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class C,D,E,F matcherStyle\">graph TD\n    A[查找节点] --&gt; B{匹配方式}\n    B --&gt; C[onNodeWithText]\n    B --&gt; D[onNodeWithTag]\n    B --&gt; E[onNodeWithContentDescription]\n    B --&gt; F[\"onNode(matcher)\"]\n\n    C --&gt; G[断言 / 操作]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n\n    classDef matcherStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class C,D,E,F matcherStyle</pre><p>在代码中添加测试标签：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun SearchBar(query: String, onQueryChange: (String) -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    OutlinedTextField(&#10;        value = query,&#10;        onValueChange = onQueryChange,&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .testTag(&quot;search_bar&quot;),&#10;        placeholder = { Text(&quot;搜索...&quot;) }&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SearchBar(query: String, onQueryChange: (String) -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    OutlinedTextField(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        value = query,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onValueChange = onQueryChange,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .testTag(\"search_bar\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        placeholder = { Text(\"搜索...\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"断言\">断言</h2><p>断言验证节点的属性和状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Test&#10;fun toggleButton_switchesState() {&#10;    var isEnabled by mutableStateOf(false)&#10;&#10;    composeRule.setContent {&#10;        Switch(&#10;            checked = isEnabled,&#10;            onCheckedChange = { isEnabled = it },&#10;            modifier = Modifier.semantics { testTag = &quot;toggle&quot; }&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;toggle&quot;)&#10;        .assertIsOff()&#10;        .performClick()&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;toggle&quot;)&#10;        .assertIsOn()&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Test&#10;fun lazyColumn_displaysCorrectItemCount() {&#10;    composeRule.setContent {&#10;        LazyColumn {&#10;            items(20) { index -&gt;&#10;                Text(&quot;Item $index&quot;, modifier = Modifier.testTag(&quot;item_$index&quot;))&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;item_0&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;item_19&quot;).assertDoesNotExist()&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;item_0&quot;).performScrollTo()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun toggleButton_switchesState() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var isEnabled by mutableStateOf(false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Switch(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            checked = isEnabled,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onCheckedChange = { isEnabled = it },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.semantics { testTag = \"toggle\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"toggle\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .assertIsOff()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .performClick()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"toggle\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .assertIsOn()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun lazyColumn_displaysCorrectItemCount() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items(20) { index -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(\"Item $index\", modifier = Modifier.testTag(\"item_$index\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"item_0\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"item_19\").assertDoesNotExist()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"item_0\").performScrollTo()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用断言：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>断言</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>assertIsDisplayed()</code></td>\n<td>节点可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertDoesNotExist()</code></td>\n<td>节点不存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertIsEnabled()</code> / <code>assertIsNotEnabled()</code></td>\n<td>启用/禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertIsOn()</code> / <code>assertIsOff()</code></td>\n<td>开关状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertHasClickAction()</code></td>\n<td>可点击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertTextEquals(&quot;text&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>文本值精确匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertTextContains(&quot;part&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>文本包含</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"操作\">操作</h2><p>操作模拟用户在 UI 上的交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Test&#10;fun swipeToDelete_removesItem() {&#10;    val items = mutableStateListOf(&quot;Item 1&quot;, &quot;Item 2&quot;, &quot;Item 3&quot;)&#10;&#10;    composeRule.setContent {&#10;        SwipeableList(items = items, onDelete = { items.remove(it) })&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Item 2&quot;).performTouchInput {&#10;        swipeLeft()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;Item 2&quot;).assertDoesNotExist()&#10;    composeRule.onAllNodesWithTag(&quot;list_item&quot;).assertCountEquals(2)&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Test&#10;fun longPress_showsContextMenu() {&#10;    composeRule.setContent {&#10;        ArticleCard(article = sampleArticle)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithText(sampleArticle.title).performTouchInput {&#10;        longClick()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;编辑&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithText(&quot;删除&quot;).assertIsDisplayed()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun swipeToDelete_removesItem() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val items = mutableStateListOf(\"Item 1\", \"Item 2\", \"Item 3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SwipeableList(items = items, onDelete = { items.remove(it) })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Item 2\").performTouchInput {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        swipeLeft()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"Item 2\").assertDoesNotExist()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onAllNodesWithTag(\"list_item\").assertCountEquals(2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun longPress_showsContextMenu() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ArticleCard(article = sampleArticle)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithText(sampleArticle.title).performTouchInput {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        longClick()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"编辑\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithText(\"删除\").assertIsDisplayed()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点击</td>\n<td><code>performClick()</code></td>\n<td>单击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本输入</td>\n<td><code>performTextInput(&quot;text&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>输入文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动</td>\n<td><code>performTouchInput { swipeLeft() }</code></td>\n<td>触摸手势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动</td>\n<td><code>performScrollTo()</code></td>\n<td>滚动到可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长按</td>\n<td><code>performTouchInput { longClick() }</code></td>\n<td>长按</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清除文本</td>\n<td><code>performTextClearance()</code></td>\n<td>清空输入框</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"截图测试\">截图测试</h2><p>Compose 支持与截图测试工具集成，捕获 UI 快照进行视觉回归测试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Test&#10;fun productCard_snapshot() {&#10;    composeRule.setContent {&#10;        ProductCard(&#10;            product = Product(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;测试商品&quot;, 99.0, imageUrl = &quot;&quot;),&#10;            onClick = {}&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(&quot;product_card&quot;)&#10;        .captureToImage()&#10;        .assertAgainstGolden(screenshotRule, &quot;product_card_default&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun productCard_snapshot() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ProductCard(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            product = Product(\"1\", \"测试商品\", 99.0, imageUrl = \"\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onClick = {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    composeRule.onNodeWithTag(\"product_card\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .captureToImage()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .assertAgainstGolden(screenshotRule, \"product_card_default\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>Modifier.testTag()</code> 为需要测试的 Composable 添加标签，这是推荐的定位方式，比依赖文本内容更稳定。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>ComposeTestRule</code> 是 Compose UI 测试的入口，支持独立和集成两种模式</li>\n<li>语义匹配器通过文本、标签、内容描述等方式查找 UI 节点</li>\n<li>断言验证节点的显示状态、启用状态、文本内容等属性</li>\n<li>操作模拟点击、输入、滑动等用户交互</li>\n<li><code>Modifier.testTag()</code> 是推荐的节点定位方式，比文本匹配更稳定</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compose UI 测试","id":"compose-ui-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ComposeTestRule","id":"composetestrule"},{"level":2,"text":"语义匹配器","id":"语义匹配器"},{"level":2,"text":"断言","id":"断言"},{"level":2,"text":"操作","id":"操作"},{"level":2,"text":"截图测试","id":"截图测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"单元测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/unit-testing"},"next":{"title":"Espresso UI 测试框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/testing/espresso"}}